<node id="Neurological Impairment">
  <data key="d0">mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">Compromise of brain function, ranging from altered mental status to coma. Can be caused by hypoxia, ischemia, infection, or metabolic disturbances.</data>
  <data key="d2">9</data>
</node>
